Increasing CPU utilization in your ONNX runtime application on Android can be achieved through several strategies. Here are a few suggestions:

### 1. Multi-Threading

If you're running your ONNX model sequentially, it can be beneficial to run it in parallel using multiple threads. This can be achieved using Java's `ExecutorService` or Kotlin's `CoroutineScope`. 

